# Klaw, Sonic Subjugator: "target player reveals a number of cards from their hand equal to one plus the number of creature cards in
# your graveyard. You choose one of them. That player discards that card" (CR 701.20a, 608.2d). Faithless Looting leaves one creature
# card (Savannah Lions) in Bot1's graveyard, and the Island beside it is no creature, so on turn 3 Bot2 reveals two cards of its
# choosing (Lightning Bolt and Counterspell, not the Islands) and Bot1 chooses Counterspell: Bot2 discards it and keeps the Bolt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Faithless Looting
Klaw, Sonic Subjugator
Swamp
Swamp
Savannah Lions
Island
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
